    </div></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="card-hd flex justify-between items-center"><h3>Created by Me</h3></div><div class="card-bd-nopad">
      <div class="hover-row flex items-center gap3" onclick="show('issue-detail')" style="cursor:pointer"><span class="mono fs12 muted">AIPM-45</span><span class="flex-1 fs13 fw5">Gantt chart timeline view</span><span class="tag tag-med">Med</span><span class="av">T</span></div>
      <div class="hover-row flex items-center gap3" onclick="show('issue-detail')" style="cursor:pointer"><span class="mono fs12 muted">AIPM-40</span><span class="flex-1 fs13 fw5">API Key anomaly detection engine</span><span class="tag tag-hi">High</span><span class="av">T</span></div>
      <div class="hover-row flex items-center gap3" onclick="show('issue-detail')" style="cursor:pointer"><span class="mono fs12 muted">AIPM-33</span><span class="flex-1 fs13 fw5">MCP HITL async confirmation</span><span class="tag tag-lo">Low</span><span class="av">T</span></div>
    </div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex gap4" style="flex-direction:column">
    <!-- ★ AI Summary — 3 tiers -->
    <div class="card ai-glow"><div class="card-hd"><div class="fs11 fw6" style="letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:hsl(var(--brand))"><span class="pulse"></span>AI Summary — Alice (PM)</div></div><div class="card-bd fs13" style="line-height:1.7">
      <div class="mb4" style="padding:10px;background:hsl(var(--brand-s));border-radius:var(--r)">
        <p class="fw6 brand mb4">📋 Pending Tasks Analysis</p>
        <p class="mb4">You have <strong>5 open tasks</strong>. AIPM-42 and AIPM-38 are <span class="tag tag-hi">High Priority</span> and should be completed within 3 days.</p>
        <p class="mb4"><span class="warn fw6">⚠ Risk:</span> AIPM-21 is blocked by AIPM-18 (DB migration). Suggest escalating during standup.</p>
        <p>💡 <strong>Recommendation:</strong> Focus on AIPM-42 first (small scope, blocks Bob's review). Delegate AIPM-29 to Charlie (has capacity).</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mb4" style="padding:10px;background:hsl(var(--sf-h));border-radius:var(--r)">
        <p class="fw6 pri mb4">📈 Work Review & Improvement</p>
        <p class="mb4">Last sprint: completed <strong>8 tasks (22 SP)</strong>. Strengths: high code quality (0 reopens), fast PR turnaround (avg 6h).</p>
        <p class="mb4">Area to improve: <span class="muted">Bug fix cycle is 2.3 days (team avg 1.5).</span> Consider pairing on complex bugs to reduce debug time.</p>
        <p>💡 As PM, your task distribution is balanced, but <strong>code review bottleneck</strong> is slowing the team. Suggest adding Bob as secondary reviewer.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="padding:10px;background:hsl(var(--s-s));border-radius:var(--r)">
        <p class="fw6 success-text mb4">📊 Project Overview (2 projects managed)</p>
        <div class="mb4"><strong>AIPM Self Hosted:</strong> Sprint 3 at 60% — on track. Health: 78/100 (At Risk — 2 unassigned bugs). <a href="#" class="brand fw6" onclick="show('project-home')">View details →</a></div>
        <div class="mb4"><strong>Mobile App Redesign:</strong> Planning phase — 5 members onboarded. Kickoff Jun 12. <a href="#" class="brand fw6" onclick="show('project-home')">View details →</a></div>
        <p class="muted fs11">💡 AIPM project has 2× velocity of MOB. Consider rebalancing senior devs to accelerate MOB kickoff.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="muted fs12" style="border-top:1px solid hsl(var(--e-d));padding-top:8px;margin-top:12px">Generated at 9:00 AM · Claude Opus 4.8 · Refreshes every 6 hours</p>
    </div></div>

    <!-- ★ AI Health — personal -->
    <div class="card"><div class="card-hd"><h3>My Health Score</h3></div><div class="card-bd" style="padding:12px 16px">
      <div class="flex items-center gap4 mb4"><div style="width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;border:4px solid hsl(var(--brand));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:hsl(var(--brand))">78</div><div class="fs13" style="line-height:1.6"><p class="fw6">Your work health is <span class="brand">At Risk</span></p><p class="muted fs12">Task completion is solid, but work-life balance shows overload (5 active tasks vs recommended 3). Code review speed is excellent. Consider delegating or pushing low-priority items.</p></div></div>
      <div class="mb4"><div class="flex justify-between fs12 mb4"><span>Task Completion</span><span class="fw6 brand">85% ↑</span></div><div class="progress"><div class="progress-bar brand" style="width:85%"></div></div></div>
      <div class="mb4"><div class="flex justify-between fs12 mb4"><span>On-Time Delivery</span><span class="fw6 brand">80%</span></div><div class="progress"><div class="progress-bar brand" style="width:80%"></div></div></div>
      <div class="mb4"><div class="flex justify-between fs12 mb4"><span>PR Review Speed</span><span class="fw6 success-text">95% ↑</span></div><div class="progress"><div class="progress-bar success" style="width:95%"></div></div></div>
      <div class="mb4"><div class="flex justify-between fs12 mb4"><span>Work-Life Balance</span><span class="fw6 warn">45% ↓</span></div><div class="progress"><div class="progress-bar warn" style="width:45%"></div></div></div>
