<div id="v-issue-create" class="view-off">
<div class="ch"><div class="flex items-center gap3"><a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="show('issues')" class="btn btn-g">&larr; Back to Issues</a><h2>Create Issue</h2></div><div class="flex gap2"><button class="btn btn-b">Create Issue</button><button class="btn btn-s">Cancel</button></div></div>
<div class="cb">
<input type="hidden" id="copy-from" value="">
<div style="max-width:900px">

  <!-- ═══ MAIN FORM — dominant, large input areas ═══ -->
  <div class="card mb4">
    <div class="card-bd" style="padding:28px 32px">

      <!-- Row 1: Project + Type -->
      <div class="form-row mb4">
        <div class="form-grp"><label class="form-label">Project</label><select class="form-select" style="width:100%;padding:10px 14px;font-size:14px"><option>TomatoHub Core Platform (AIPM)</option></select></div>
        <div class="form-grp"><label class="form-label">Issue Type</label><select class="form-select" style="width:100%;padding:10px 14px;font-size:14px"><option>Bug</option><option>Task</option><option>Story</option><option>Epic</option></select></div>
      </div>

      <!-- ★ Title — large, prominent -->
      <div class="form-grp mb4">
        <label class="form-label">Title</label>
        <input class="form-input" placeholder="What needs to be done?" style="padding:14px 16px;font-size:16px;font-weight:500">
      </div>

      <!-- ★ Description — large textarea -->
      <div class="form-grp mb4">
        <label class="form-label">Description</label>
        <textarea class="form-input" placeholder="Describe the issue in detail. Include steps to reproduce, expected behavior, and any relevant context.&#10;&#10;Markdown supported." style="min-height:220px;padding:14px 16px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;resize:vertical;font-family:var(--f)"></textarea>
      </div>

      <!-- Row 2: Priority + Assignee + SP -->
      <div class="form-row mb4">
        <div class="form-grp"><label class="form-label">Priority</label><select class="form-select" style="width:100%;padding:10px 14px;font-size:14px"><option>Medium</option><option>Critical</option><option>High</option><option>Low</option></select></div>
        <div class="form-grp"><label class="form-label">Assignee</label><select class="form-select" style="width:100%;padding:10px 14px;font-size:14px"><option>Unassigned</option><option>Alice</option><option>Bob</option><option>Charlie</option></select></div>
        <div class="form-grp"><label class="form-label">Story Points</label><input class="form-input" type="number" min="1" max="100" placeholder="Estimate" style="width:100%;padding:10px 14px;font-size:14px"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Row 3: Sprint + Parent + Security -->
      <div class="form-row mb4">
        <div class="form-grp"><label class="form-label">Sprint</label><select class="form-select" style="width:100%;padding:10px 14px;font-size:14px"><option>Sprint 3 (current)</option><option>Backlog</option><option>Sprint 4 (next)</option></select></div>
        <div class="form-grp"><label class="form-label">Parent Issue</label><input class="form-input" placeholder="e.g. AIPM-10" style="padding:10px 14px;font-size:14px"></div>
        <div class="form-grp"><label class="form-label">Security Level</label><select class="form-select" style="width:100%;padding:10px 14px;font-size:14px"><option>None (public)</option><option>Internal</option><option>Confidential</option></select></div>
      </div>

      <div class="form-grp"><label class="form-label">Labels</label><input class="form-input" placeholder="Press Enter to add labels" style="padding:10px 14px;font-size:14px"></div>

      <div class="flex gap2 justify-between mt4" style="padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid hsl(var(--e-d))">
        <button class="btn btn-s fs13" onclick="document.getElementById('ai-review-panel').classList.toggle('view-off')">🤖 AI Review</button>
        <div class="flex gap2"><button class="btn btn-b fs13" style="padding:10px 24px">Create Issue</button><button class="btn btn-s fs13">Cancel</button></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ═══ AI REVIEW PANEL — supporting, appears below form ═══ -->
  <div id="ai-review-panel" class="view-off card ai-glow">
    <div class="card-hd"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><div class="flex items-center gap2"><span class="pulse"></span><span class="fs13 fw6 brand">🤖 AI Review Results</span></div><span class="fs11 muted">Analyzed just now · Claude Opus 4.8</span></div></div>
    <div class="card-bd" style="padding:20px 24px">

      <!-- ★ Optimized Title — one-click replace -->
      <div style="background:hsl(var(--brand-s));padding:14px 16px;border-radius:var(--r);margin-bottom:16px">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb4"><span class="fs12 fw6 brand">✨ Optimized Title</span><button class="btn btn-b btn-xs" title="Replace current title with this optimized version">Replace</button></div>
        <p class="fs14 fw6" style="line-height:1.5">Fix login page responsive layout — mobile viewport causes form overflow due to hidden sidebar residual width</p>
      </div>

      <!-- ★ Optimized Description — one-click replace -->
      <div style="background:hsl(var(--brand-s));padding:14px 16px;border-radius:var(--r);margin-bottom:16px">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb4"><span class="fs12 fw6 brand">✨ Optimized Description</span><button class="btn btn-b btn-xs">Replace</button></div>
        <div class="fs13" style="line-height:1.7">
          <p class="mb4"><strong>Summary:</strong> The login page layout breaks on mobile viewports (&lt;768px). The split-panel flex layout leaves the hidden sidebar still occupying layout space, causing the form card to overflow horizontally.</p>
          <p class="mb4"><strong>Steps to Reproduce:</strong></p><ol style="padding-left:20px;margin-bottom:8px"><li>Open login page on Chrome 125, iPhone SE viewport</li><li>Observe sidebar space still visible in layout</li><li>Note form inputs overflowing card boundary</li></ol>
          <p><strong>Expected Behavior:</strong> Full-width centered card. Brand logo above form. Sidebar fully hidden. Form inputs constrained within card width.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ★ Duplicate Check — merged into AI Review -->
      <div style="margin-bottom:16px">
        <div class="fs12 fw6 mb4">🔍 Duplicate Check — Found 2 similar issues</div>
        <div class="grid2">
          <div style="padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid hsl(var(--e-d));border-radius:var(--r);cursor:pointer" onclick="show('issue-detail')">
            <div class="flex justify-between mb4"><span class="mono fs12 fw6 brand">AIPM-18</span><span class="tag tag-hi">78% match</span></div>
            <p class="fs12 mb4">Responsive layout breaks on auth pages — similar root cause (flex layout). Same developer (Alice).</p>
            <p class="fs11 muted">⚠ Consider merging or linking instead of creating duplicate</p>
          </div>
          <div style="padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid hsl(var(--e-d));border-radius:var(--r);cursor:pointer" onclick="show('issue-detail')">
            <div class="flex justify-between mb4"><span class="mono fs12 fw6 brand">AIPM-22</span><span class="tag tag-med">62% match</span></div>
            <p class="fs12 mb4">Mobile navigation menu overflow — related component (sidebar). Partial overlap in scope.</p>
            <p class="fs11 muted">Partial overlap · Consider linking as related</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ★ Field-level suggestions -->
      <div>
        <div class="fs12 fw6 mb4">💡 Field Suggestions</div>
        <div class="grid2 fs12" style="line-height:1.6">
          <div style="padding:8px 10px;background:hsl(var(--sf-h));border-radius:var(--r)">✅ <strong>Title:</strong> Clear and specific — good</div>
          <div style="padding:8px 10px;background:hsl(var(--sf-h));border-radius:var(--r)">💡 <strong>Priority:</strong> Suggest <span class="tag tag-hi">High</span> — user-facing bug</div>
          <div style="padding:8px 10px;background:hsl(var(--sf-h));border-radius:var(--r)">💡 <strong>Assignee:</strong> Alice already on AIPM-18 (related). Suggest <strong>Bob</strong></div>
          <div style="padding:8px 10px;background:hsl(var(--sf-h));border-radius:var(--r)">💡 <strong>SP:</strong> Suggest <strong>5 SP</strong> (similar issues avg 4-6)</div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

</div>
</div></div>

