      <div class="flex-1"><div class="fs13 fw6">Denied: bulk_update_issues(ids=["AIPM-45","AIPM-48"], sprint_id="S4")</div><div class="fs11 muted">Claude Code · Bob denied · Jun 7, 3:20 PM · Reason: "Keep these in Sprint 3"</div></div>
      <span class="tag tag-hi">Denied</span>
